            "rubricHtml": "<p>Questions 1–5</p>",
            "selectCount": 1,
            "bodyHtml": "<p>Complete the notes below. Write <strong>ONE WORD ONLY</strong> for each answer.</p><div><div class=\"notes-title\"><strong>Poppy Reserve in Sandcastle</strong></div><ul><li>Almond Valley Poppy Reserve is a nature reserve</li><li>the poppies will be at their best at the end of the {{1}}</li><li>the poppies on the hills are {{2}} in colour</li><li>the reserve is located to the {{3}} of Lakeside</li><li>the best time for photography is mid-afternoon</li><li>wear {{4}} because of rattlesnakes</li><li>the reserve is a {{5}} park</li></ul></div>",
            "maxWords": 1
          },
          {
            "id": "part-1-group-2",
            "type": "completion",
            "rubricHtml": "<p>Questions 6–10</p>",
            "selectCount": 1,
            "bodyHtml": "<p>Complete the table below. Write <strong>ONE WORD AND/OR A NUMBER</strong> for each answer.</p><div><table class=\"q-table\"><tbody><tr><th>Tour</th><th>Start time</th><th>Duration</th><th>Highlights</th><th>Photography</th></tr><tr><td>The {{6}} tour</td><td>every hour from 7:30 a.m.</td><td>30 minutes</td><td>viewpoints, film and the {{7}}</td><td>panoramic pictures</td></tr><tr><td>The Wildflower tour</td><td>every two hours from 8:00 a.m.</td><td>{{8}}</td><td>poppy, cream cup, and sage</td><td>close-up tips</td></tr><tr><td>The Wildlife tour</td><td>{{9}} a.m. or 7:00 p.m.</td><td>1.5 hours</td><td>coyote, quail, roadrunners</td><td>bring tripod and a {{10}} lens</td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
            "maxWords": 2
